OL,1,Vk4                               G9/10
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGMANDELA CRITICISES
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCLAMPDOWN
OL,5, ANC leader Nelson Mandela has attacked
OL,6, the South African government's
OL,7, response to recent faction fighting.
OL,9,F"Put simply, that is licence given to
OL,10,Fthe security forces to kill our
OL,11,Fpeople," Mr Mandela said.
OL,13,FHe said 700 black people were killed
OL,14,Fwhile it ignored the problem, but
OL,15,Fnow that two white policemen had been
OL,16,Fkilled it was prepared to take action.
OL,18,FEarlier he blamed the Pretoria
OL,19,Fgovernment for fuelling violence in
OL,20,Fthe black townships and working with a
OL,21,Fvariety of vigilantes.
OL,23,D]FFromG15-09-90F  teletextarchive.com
